{
    "name": "道路",
    "category": "tfg:logistics",
    "icon": "rnr:rock/sett_road/quartzite",
    "pages": [
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "text": "$(li)$(bold)$(l:logistics/roads#intro)道路建造$()$(li)$(bold)$(l:logistics/roads#mattock)鶴嘴鋤$()$(li)$(bold)$(l:logistics/roads#base_course)基層$()$(li)$(bold)$(l:logistics/roads#pavers)鋪面材料$()$(li2)$(l:logistics/roads#hoggin)混合碎石$()$(li2)$(l:logistics/roads#gravel_fill)礫石填料$()$(li2)$(l:logistics/roads#stone)鵝卵石、方石與石板$()$(li2)$(l:logistics/roads#concrete)混凝土$()$(li2)$(l:logistics/roads#asphalt)瀝青$()$(li)$(bold)$(l:logistics/roads#paving_cart)鋪路車$()",
            "title": "索引",
            "anchor": "index"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "anchor": "intro",
            "title": "簡介",
            "text": "建造道路能大幅提升陸路運輸效率，分為三個基本步驟：$(li)$(bold)1：$()用$(l:logistics/roads#mattock)鶴嘴鋤$()夯實原生土壤。$(li)$(bold)2：$()鋪設$(l:logistics/roads#base_course)碎石基層$()。$(li)$(bold)3：$()鋪設表面的$(l:logistics/roads#pavers)鋪面材料$()。$(br)不同種類的道路使用不同材料。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
            "item": "tag:rnr:mattocks",
            "title": "鶴嘴鋤",
            "anchor": "mattock",
            "text": "鶴嘴鋤可像$(l:craftsmanship/chisel)鑿子$()一樣用在泥土類方塊上。在預設的方塊模式下，按$(item)$(k:key.use)$()即可夯實這些方塊。若夯實的是泥巴或泥濘根土，產生的夯實泥巴必須鋪上碎石基層來改良。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
            "item": "rnr:crushed_base_course",
            "title": "基層",
            "anchor": "base_course",
            "text": "夯實土壤後，下一步是鋪設道路基層。碎石基層可用礫石或石粉混合碎石合成，按$(item)$(k:key.use)$()即可鋪在夯實的方塊上，為最終路面提供堅固的基礎。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
            "item": "tag:rnr:road_materials",
            "title": "鋪面材料",
            "anchor": "pavers",
            "text": "建造道路的最後一步是鋪設路面。$(l:logistics/roads#stone)磚塊$()、$(l:logistics/roads#hoggin)混合碎石$()、$(l:logistics/roads#stone)碎石$()等物品都可按$(item)$(k:key.use)$()鋪在基層上形成道路。不同物品會形成不同種類的道路，提供不同程度的行走速度加成。"
        },
        {
            "type": "tfg:multimultiblock",
            "text": "夯實、鋪設基層，以及用磚塊鋪面的過程。",
            "multiblocks": [
